# Local-only planning docs (kept out of the repo per maintainer preference).
# NOTE: PROGRESS.md is still git-tracked, so this entry has no effect until it
# is also untracked (`git rm --cached PROGRESS.md` to remove from the repo, or
# `git update-index --skip-worktree PROGRESS.md` to keep it in the repo but
# ignore local edits). PHASE-15-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md is untracked, so this
# ignores it immediately.
/PROGRESS.md
/PHASE-15-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md

# Pandoc-generated HTML companions of the project's .md docs. The .md
# files are the source of truth; rebuild locally with `pandoc x.md -o x.html`.
/PROGRESS.html
/improvements.html
/roadmap.html
/OUTREACH-PLAN.html
/outreach-templates.html
